00:55:22,222 --> 00:55:28,222
Kong (2021), the fifth Godzilla film to be completely produced by a Hollywood studio, and the fifth film in the
Monsterverse franchise, also serving as the 38th film of the Godzilla franchise and 13th in the King Kong franchise.

14
