Hall, Henry, and Hottle reprise their roles from the previous film.

16
01:08:08,888 --> 01:08:14,888
In the film, Kong encounters more of his species in the Hollow Earth and must unite again with Godzilla to stop
the tyrannical Skar King and the powerful, frost-breathing Shimo from invading the Earth's surface.

17
01:12:24,444 --> 01:12:30,444
Following the box office and streaming success of Godzilla vs.

18
01:16:40,000 --> 01:16:46,000
Kong during the COVID-19 pandemic, Legendary announced a sequel in March
2022 and that filming would commence later that year.

19
01:20:55,555 --> 01:21:01,555
In May 2022, it was announced that Wingard would return to
direct and Stevens had been cast as a lead.

20
01:25:11,111 --> 01:25:17,111
Filming began in July 2022 in Gold Coast,
Australia, and finished in November 2022.

21
01:29:26,666 --> 01:29:32,666
Godzilla x Kong: The New Empire premiered at Grauman's Chinese Theatre on March
25, 2024, and was released in the United States on March 29.

22
01:33:42,222 --> 01:33:48,222
The film received mixed reviews from critics, with many comparing it unfavorably
to Godzilla Minus One, which had been released four months prior.

23
01:37:57,777 --> 01:38:03,777
It grossed $572.5 million worldwide against a production budget of $135–150 million, becoming the eighth-highest-grossing film
of 2024 and the highest-grossing film of the Monsterverse, as well as in the Godzilla and King Kong franchises.

24
01:42:13,333 --> 01:42:19,333
A sequel, Godzilla x Kong: Supernova, is slated for March 26, 2027.

25
